always skip and come back to these later)<br></li><li> <strong>Puzzles</strong>, occasionally apart from reflexes, your puzzle solving skills will be put to the test</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506090/extras/ed9081c203780e8a2d38d384927225da.poster.avif?t=1518185612\" width=522 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506090/extras/ed9081c203780e8a2d38d384927225da.webm?t=1518185612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506090/extras/ed9081c203780e8a2d38d384927225da.mp4?t=1518185612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
